rfc8693-token-exchange.decisionDiagram:
flowchart LR
    T[Delegated token arrives] --> V{Signature and audience valid}
    V -- no --> R1[401 invalid_token]
    V -- yes --> S{Scope covers this tool}
    S -- no --> R2[403 insufficient_scope]
    S -- yes --> C{act claim present}
    C -- no --> R3[403 broken actor chain]
    C -- yes --> AZ{PingOne Authorize}
    AZ -- DENY --> R4[403 with reason]
    AZ -- PERMIT --> OK[Tool executes]
